  "title": "Chapter 4: Speed Limits",
  "order": 5,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "prlm8sl",
      "content": "Speed limits are defined under Section 112 of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988. Driving above the limit is an offence. State governments can set lower limits for their roads."
    },
