      "content": "General Speed Limits"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "General Speed Limits define the baseline permissible driving speeds across different road categories.",
        "Special Speed Restrictions apply mandatory speed reductions in sensitive zones such as school corridors and hospital areas.",
        "Drivers must adapt their speed according to vehicle class, road conditions, and regulatory signage."
      ],
      "id": "10ak646"
    },
